<!-- PHILOSOPHY -->
<section class="section">

<h2>
Why Plays Instead of Prescriptions
</h2>

<p>
Complex systems rarely improve through rigid processes.
</p>

<p>
Instead, improvement happens through structured experiments.
</p>

<p>
Plays provide facilitation formats and practical techniques
that teams can use to explore new ways of working and learn
what works in their own context.
</p>

